erior  The blue bowtie stitch is on the superior margin  There is no gross tumor present  The specimen is entirely submitted  Micro 1  superior margin  4 frags  ESS Micro 2  inferior margin  mult frags  ESS Micro REMOVED_DATE  perpendicular section with respect to posterior and anterior margin  from superior to inferior  8 frags  ESS Part two  labeled  inferior breast tissue left   consists of two fragments of pink white fibrous tissue measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm in aggregate  The specimen is grossly unremarkable  One of the fragments is bisected and the specimen is entirely submitted  Micro 7  left inferior breast tissue  2 frags  ESS xq Reports to  RHEI  ESTHER M D  SPECIMEN TYPE  BREAST BIOPSY W O MARGINS ADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE  BREAST   EXCISIONAL TISSUE W MARGINS  report_end , 0.
