s tissue containing a few small brown  clear fluid filled cysts  measuring up to REMOVED_DATE cm  admixed with approximately 60  tan yellow  lobulated  focally hemorrhagic fat  No lesions grossly consistent with an invasive carcinoma are identified  Representative sections are submitted  Micro REMOVED_DATE  Right breast tissue  5 frags total  RSS  Part 3   left TRAM flap fat necrosis   consists of a 142 gm  12 x 10 x REMOVED_DATE cm focally hemorrhagic  focally dusky  brown to tan yellow fibrofatty and unremarkable tan white skin tissue aggregate  There are multiple areas of a dusky brown  granular nature within a few pieces  These areas are  inaudible  focal areas of bright yellow possible fat necrosis  A representative section of the worst area is submitted  Micro REMOVED_DATE  Hemorrhagic dusky area  multiple frags  RSS  Part 4   redundant tissue abdominal wall closure   consists of two tan white  wrinkled skin ellipses  measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm  excised to a maximum depth of 1 2 cm and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE  inaudible  REMOVED_DATE cm each containing a  inaudible  linear  well healed scar  measuring REMOVED_DATE cm and REMOVED_DATE cm  respectively  A representative section of each is submitted  Micro 5  Redundant tissue  abdominal wall closure  2 frags  RSS  kks Reports to  HERGRUETER  CHARLES  A  M D  SPECIMEN TYPE  TISSUE FOR SPECIAL STUDIES ONLY ADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE  BREAST REDUCTION MAMMOPLASTY ADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE  BREAST REDUCTION MAMMOPLASTY ADDITIONAL SPECIMEN TYPE  SKIN CYST  TAG OR DEBRIDEMENT  report_end , 0.
