Accession Number  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID Report Status  Final Type  Surgical Pathology Pathology Report  REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID OPERATION DATE  19 REMOVED_MONTH 97 ACCESSIONED ON  19 REMOVED_MONTH 97 at 16 25 CLINICAL DATA  None                                                                                     FINAL DIAGNOSIS     BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY  INVASIVE MAMMARY CARCINOMA CONSISTENT WITH LOBULAR TYPE  AT LEAST REMOVED_DATE CM  PRESENT AT MULTIPLE TISSUE SURFACES  AND WITH FOCI SUSPICIOUS FOR PERINEURAL INVASION  SEE NOTE   Note  Definite blood vascular and lymphatic invasion is not seen  Diagnosis by  Dennis Sgroi  M D  Signed On  26 REMOVED_MONTH 97 at 18 03                                                                                     RECEPTOR IMMUNOHISTOCHEMISTRY Addendum     RESULTS OF STAINING OF FIXED TISSUE FOR HORMONE RECEPTOR PROTEINS Breast  Right   The tumor cells stain for estrogen receptor protein  The tumor cells stain for progesterone receptor protein  See note  Note  In this laboratory  we used this antibody to stain 100 breast carcinomas prepared in the usual way  paraffin sections  and we compared the results with determinations of estrogen receptor by biochemical assay  91  of tumors that stained with this antibody were positive for estrogen receptors by biochemical assay  96  of tumors that failed to stain with this antibody were negative for estrogen receptors by biochemical assay  When we compared the results of staining of paraffin sections with the results of staining of frozen sections  the predictive value of a positive result was 97  and the predictive value of a negative result was 95   In this laboratory  we also compared the results of staining of 100 routinely processed breast carcinomas with determinations of progesterone receptors by a hormone binding assay  Sixty five percent of tumors that stained with this antibody contained progesterone receptors by the biochemical assay  and 98  of tumors that failed to stain lacked the receptors  Added by  Dennis Sgroi  M D  Signed On  26 REMOVED_MONTH 97 at 18 03 GROSS DESCRIPTION  Received fresh in the Frozen Section Lab  labeled with the patient s name and unit number  and  right breast   is a REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm tan pink fibroadipose tissue  entirely submitted in A  Resident  KRISTINA M  BRAATEN  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     NO FROZEN DONE O R  Resident  IVANA DELALLE  MD  PHD O R  Diagnosis by  Gunnlaugur P  Nielsen  MD                                                                                 SOURCE CARE UNIT  SAME DAY SURGICAL UNIT   REMOVED_ACCESSION_ID REPORTS TO  David L Berger  M D  PART   BREAST  RIGHT   EXCISIONAL BIOPSY  report_end , 1.
