n  labeled with the patient s name  unit number  and  scar  left breast   and consists of an unoriented skin ellipse  3 9 x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm   In the center of the light tan skin is a furrow  2 5 cm  as well as a nodule  1 1 cm  with slight brown pigmentation  The furrow comes to within REMOVED_DATE cm of the edge  and the nodule extends to the edge  The surgical margin is inked in black and the specimen is entirely submitted for histologic analysis  Micro 1  skin tips  2 frag  ESS Micro REMOVED_DATE  remainder of specimen  multi frag  ESS gmw Reports to  BREUING  KARL  HEINZ  ULRICH M D  SPECIMEN TYPE  SKIN  OTHER THAN CYST  TAG OR DEBRIDEMENT  report_end , 0.
