llow  The entire specimen is then inked black  The specimen is sectioned to reveal mostly firm  fibrous tissue with gray white tissue centrally  No discrete mass is seen  No frozen done  The specimen is entirely submitted from lateral to medial as A through I  A photograph is taken of the section submitted as C  Resident  James Kirby  MD     INTRA OPERATIVE DIAGNOSIS     GROSS DIAGNOSIS  BREAST LEFT  RE EXCISION  NO DISCRETE MASS IDENTIFIED  AWAIT PERMANENT SECTIONS FOR FINAL DIAGNOSIS  O R  Resident  Daniel D  Koelliker  MD O R  Diagnosis by  Judith Ann Ferry  M D                                                                                  SOURCE CARE UNIT  SURGICAL DAY CARE   ACC 3 REPORTS TO  Barbara Lynn Smith  M D  PART   BREAST  LEFT   RE EXCISION  report_end , 0.
