us incision scar noted  the skin is grossly umremarkable as is the nipple  Sectioning through the breast parenchyma demonstrates yellow lobules of fat with intervening white streaks of fibrous appearing tissue  In the lateral aspect beneath the incision scar seen on the skin  there is a stellate region with yellow chalky white fat necrosis appearing areas and streaks of grey to white fibrous tissue emanating from this area  The tissue in this region is rubbery to firm  Sectioning through the breast parenchyma does not reveal any area grossly suspicious for infiltrating carcinoma  Also received within the same specimen container are two fragments of skin and underlying fibroadipose tissue  These fragments measure REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm  and REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm  One fragment has a defect hole in the center of it  measuring REMOVED_DATE cm  in diameter  No other abnormalities are noted  Micro 14   biopsy site Micro 15   biopsy site  inferior margin Micro 16   biopsy site  blue ink   inferior and black ink   deep margin Micro 17   biopsy site  no margin Micro 18   biopsy site  no margin Micro REMOVED_DATE   biopsy site  inferior and deep margins Micro REMOVED_DATE   deep margin Micro 24   nipple  superior margin Micro 25   breast tissue away from biopsy site  superior medially Micro REMOVED_DATE   breast parenchyma in the medial REMOVED_DATE of the breast Micro 28   two smaller skin fragments included in the specimen container  RSS Labeled   3  upper skin flap   is an aggregate of unremarkable fibroadipose tissue  measuring REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE x REMOVED_DATE cm  No skin is attached to this specimen  Representative sections are submitted in cassette 29  Reports to  KANE  J GREGORY M D  SPECIMEN TYPE  LUMPECTOMY  report_end , 1.
